WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.062
Watch and read: For your storystructure practice, read: “Ama found a red ball at the

00:00:05.062 --> 00:00:09.924
playground. Ama gave it back to Kojo. The day ended happily.” Who is the main

00:00:09.924 --> 00:00:10.248
character?

00:00:11.117 --> 00:00:15.234
The answer is: Ama. The character is the person the story is about.

